flowchart TD
    CSV[Supplied catalog CSV and curated requirements] --> ETL[Original ETL and prerequisite parser]
    ETL --> KG[Explicit RDF KG and unchanged ontology IRIs]
    KG --> OWL[OWL RL schema closure]
    Q[Student question] --> LINK[Entity and intent linking]
    LINK --> QUERY[Parameterized SPARQL]
    LINK --> REASON[AND/OR multi-hop Python reasoner]
    KG --> QUERY
    OWL --> QUERY
    KG --> REASON
    QUERY --> CONTEXT[Rows + paths + labelled edge evidence]
    REASON --> CONTEXT
    CONTEXT --> CHECK{Enough supported context?}
    CHECK -->|yes| LLM[Local Qwen3 via Ollama]
    CHECK -->|no| ABSTAIN[Insufficient evidence]
    LLM --> OUT[Actual answer + full provenance + citation checks]
    OUT --> REVIEW[Human-scored A/B evaluation]
    BASE[Same question and same LLM without retrieval] --> REVIEW
